Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:57:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(net): migrate remaining user and ping packets

- switch score ranking, rival music, shop stock, ping, and chargelog packets to typed VOs

- fix duplicated MaimaiChn suffix during score ranking pagination

- add score ranking pagination regression coverage

